      "toWord": "w22"
    },
    {
      "text": "but this first shape looks flat and tired.",
      "start": 7.523,
      "end": 10.647,
      "fromWord": "w23",
      "toWord": "w30"
    },
    {
      "text": "For one moment she considers hiding",
      "start": 10.647,
      "end": 13.095,
      "fromWord": "w31",
      "toWord": "w36"
    },
    {
      "text": "the creased paper and starting again.",
      "start": 13.095,
      "end": 15.738,
      "fromWord": "w37",
      "toWord": "w42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead Mira turns the lantern and notices",
      "start": 15.738,
      "end": 18.636,
      "fromWord": "w43",
      "toWord": "w49"
    },
    {
      "text": "one fold pulling its shape inward.",
      "start": 18.636,
      "end": 21.101,
      "fromWord": "w50",
      "toWord": "w55"
    },
    {
      "text": "She changes that fold then pauses",
      "start": 21.101,
      "end": 23.539,
      "fromWord": "w56",
      "toWord": "w61"
    },
    {
      "text": "to look before changing anything else.",
      "start": 23.539,
      "end": 26.02,
      "fromWord": "w62",
      "toWord": "w67"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next attempt is uneven yet now",
      "start": 26.02,
      "end": 28.485,
      "fromWord": "w68",
      "toWord": "w74"
    },
    {
      "text": "the little lantern has room to open.",
      "start": 28.485,
      "end": 30.761,
      "fromWord": "w75",
      "toWord": "w81"
    },
    {
      "text": "By evening the revised shape rests beside her",
      "start": 30.761,
      "end": 33.605,
      "fromWord": "w82",
      "toWord": "w89"
    },
    {
      "text": "original sketch and the workshop is quiet.",
      "start": 33.605,
      "end": 36.646,
      "fromWord": "w90",
      "toWord": "w96"
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside a gentle glow fills its paper walls",
      "start": 36.646,
      "end": 39.552,
      "fromWord": "w97",
      "toWord": "w104"
    },
    {
      "text": "as the terrace settles into blue shadows.",
      "start": 39.552,
      "end": 42.093,
      "fromWord": "w105",
      "toWord": "w111"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mira keeps the sketch nearby remembering",
      "start": 42.093,
      "end": 44.73,
      "fromWord": "w112",
      "toWord": "w117"
    },
    {
      "text": "how a patient revision gave her",
      "start": 44.73,
      "end": 46.467,
      "fromWord": "w118",
      "toWord": "w123"
    },
    {
      "text": "idea a life worth sharing.",
      "start": 46.467,
      "end": 48.032426303854876,
      "fromWord": "w124",
      "toWord": "w128"
    }
  ],
  "warnings": [],
  "planningMode": "explicit-beats"
}
